<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Mission 2013D Part 2, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=#008040 size=2 face=Calibri&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;V3.0&amp;nbsp; Command V1.06 DB 420&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;In September,&amp;nbsp; Mission 2013A, involved more than 40,000 troops from multiple services aimed at a large-scale island invasion either in the South China Sea or East China Sea where China has encountered strong resistance to its claims of territorial or maritime assets.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Code-named Mission 2013B, the exercises are the third installment this year of a series of military drills. Participating in the exercise are ground troops from the 42nd Army of the Guangzhou Military Region command — the military’s crack force that was the main fighting unit during the Korean War and the 1979 invasion of Vietnam.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Air force units, surface warships and amphibious vessels, and electronic warfare groups from the Guangzhou and Nanjing region commands also formed a key portion of the war games.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;A third exercise, Mission 2013C, was conducted and directed primarily by the air force.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Mission 2013D has been activated.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;China launches attack on Taiwan.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
